- Document name.
- Save status.
- Undo.
- Redo.
- Zoom.
- Page navigation.
- Search.
- Editing mode.
- Export.
- Download.

### Left sidebar

Provide panels for:
- Page thumbnails.
- Document outline.
- Bookmarks.
- Layers and objects.
- Comments and annotations.
- Forms.
- Document structure.

### Central canvas

Support:
- Accurate PDF rendering.
- Page selection.
- Zoom and pan.
- Object selection.
- Text selection where supported.
- Drag and drop.
- Resize handles.
- Rotation.
- Alignment guides.
- Multi-page navigation.

### Right properties panel

Show contextual properties:
- Position.
- Dimensions.
- Rotation.
- Font.
- Font size.
- Font weight.
- Text colour.
- Fill.
- Border.
- Opacity.
- Alignment.
- Stacking order.
- Other applicable object properties.

